n ask AI anything.</p><form class=\"index-search\" action=\"/search\"><span>⌕</span><input placeholder=\"Search burgers, shakes, calories, prices...\" aria-label=\"Search Cook Out\" name=\"q\"/><button>SEARCH</button></form><div class=\"index-hero-links\"><a href=\"/menu/\">EXPLORE MENU <b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/ai/\">ASK COOK OUT AI <b>✦</b></a></div></div><div class=\"index-hero-visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-feature-photo\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568901346375-23c9450c58cd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=85\" alt=\"Close-up burger photograph for menu inspiration\"/><div class=\"hero-feature-caption\"><span>THE MENU EDIT</span><strong>Big flavor. No guesswork.</strong><small>Explore menu items, nutrition and price information</small></div></div><span class=\"visual-tag tag-one\">MENU<br/><b>18+</b> ITEMS</span><span class=\"visual-tag tag-two\">AI<br/><b>24/7</b> GUIDE</span><span class=\"visual-tag tag-three\">SOURCE<br/><b>FIRST</b></span><span class=\"visual-tag tag-four\">NUTRITION<br/><b>CHECKED</b></span></div></div><div class=\"container hero-ticker\"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span><i></i> <span>UNOFFICIAL · INDEPENDENT · SOURCE-AWARE</span></div></section><section class=\"index-statement\"><div class=\"container statement-grid\"><div><span class=\"index-label\">01 / THE IDEA</span><h2>Not another<br/><em>menu list.</em></h2></div><div class=\"statement-copy\"><p>We are building a practical Cook Out intelligence layer — part menu guide, part nutrition explorer, part price tracker, part AI assistant.</p><p>Information is separated from estimates, location variation is surfaced, and important claims stay tied to sources.</p><a href=\"/methodology/\">READ OUR METHODOLOGY ↗</a></div></div></section><section class=\"index-discovery\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"index-section-head\"><div><span class=\"index-label\">02 / DISCOVER</span><h2>One system.<br/><em>Six ways in.</em></h2></div><a href=\"/tools/\">ALL TOOLS ↗</a></div><div class=\"discovery-grid\"><a href=\"/menu/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>01</span><div><small>MENU INDEX</small><h3>Every category, searchable</h3></div><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/prices/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>02</span><div><small>PRICE INTELLIGENCE</small><h3>Location-aware pricing</h3></div><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/nutrition/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>03</span><div><small>NUTRITION LAB</small><h3>Calories, protein &amp; sodium</h3></div><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/tools/tray-builder/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>04</span><div><small>TRAY STUDIO</small><h3>Build a custom meal</h3></div><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/tools/shake-mixer/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>05</span><div><small>SHAKE LAB</small><h3>Mix two flavors</h3></div><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/locations/\" class=\"discovery-card\"><span>06</span><div><small>LOCATION FINDER</small><h3>Explore stores &amp; hours</h3></div><b>↗</b></a></div></div></section><section class=\"index-menu\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"index-section-head\"><div><span class=\"index-label\">03 / MENU INDEX</span><h2>Pick a lane.</h2></div><a href=\"/menu/\">FULL MENU ↗</a></div><div class=\"category-index\"><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>01</span><strong>BURGERS</strong><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>02</span><strong>CHICKEN</strong><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>03</span><strong>BBQ</strong><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>04</span><strong>HOT DOGS</strong><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>05</span><strong>WRAPS</strong><b>↗</b></a><a href=\"/menu/\"><span>06</span><strong>MILKSHAKES</strong><b>↗</b></a></div></div></section><section class=\"ai-feature\"><div class=\"container ai-feature-grid\"><div><span class=\"index-label light\">04 / INTELLIGENCE</span><h2>Ask first.<br/><em>Dig deeper.</em></h2><p>Cook Out Assistant is designed to answer menu, nutrition, price, tray, shake and site questions using the information we actually publish.</p><div class=\"ai-feature-pills\">